></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UNI CHARM CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UNI-CHARM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA MICHIYO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURAKAMI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of producing throwaway trunks type wearing articles, wherein two webs (51, 52) of the same width joined together around a number of through-holes (53, 54) of the same shape and size arranged in a longitudinal row on one side of the webs are folded back along a centerline bisecting the width and the lateral edges (57) of the webs (51, 52) are joined together and so are the lateral edges (60), whereupon the webs are severed along first and second imaginary lines (G-G, H-H) extending in the direction of the width.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de production d'articles vestimentaires de type caleçon jetable, dans lequel deux bandes (51, 52) de la même largeur assemblées autour d'un certain nombre de trous traversant (53, 54) de la même taille et de la même dimension agencés en une rangée longitudinale sur un côté des bandes, sont repliées le long d'une ligne médiane bisectant la largeur et les bords latéraux (57) des bandes (51, 52) sont assemblés et constituent ainsi les bords latéraux (60), après quoi les bandes sont détachées le long de première et seconde lignes imaginaires (G-G, H-H) s'étendant dans le sens de la largeur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>